title: 밤_4_조깅하기_신아산_영문
---
(I went out to a nearby park for a jog after a long time.)
(After doing a lap around the park, I spotted a familiar figure.)
<<show san_idle_ver2>>
{name()}: Oh, ASan Shin?
<<play san_sound>>
ASan: Oh, {name()}?
(ASan was also dressed in comfortable clothes, looking like she came out to exercise.)
{name()}: Did you come out to work out too?
<<show san_smile_ver2>>
<<play 신아산_웃음>>
ASan: Yep.
<<show san_idle>>
ASan: Stamina is crucial if you want to study properly, after all.
{name()}: True. But.....
{name()}: It looks like you need a lot of it.
<<show san_neg_ver2>>
<<play 신아산_허>>
ASan: What did you say?????????
ASan: I don't think you look like much of a runner yourself, though?????
ASan: You, want to have a jogging race with me?
{name()}: Sure. But the one who gets exhausted and gives up first has to buy drinks.
<<show san_idle_ver2>>
<<play 신아산_흠>>
ASan: Fine.
ASan: Then, right now......
ASan: START!!!!!!!!!!!
(As soon as she finished talking, ASan started sprinting.)
(I ran right after her.)
(Contrary to her confidence, ASan's stamina wasn't that great, and she started lagging behind.)
<<choice 밤_4_조깅하기_신아산_긍정1_영문 "Yes" 밤_4_조깅하기_신아산_부정1_영문 "No">>
(Should I slow down on purpose?)
===

title: 밤_4_조깅하기_신아산_긍정1_영문
---
(I should slow down on purpose.)
(Since ASan has a lot of pride.)
<<show san_smile_ver2>>
<<play 신아산_웃음>>
ASan: Whoo!!!!!!! I won!!!!!!!
ASan: I knew it.
ASan: I'm a better runner, right?
{name()}: Yeah, you're fast. You went so quick in the middle there that I almost couldn't catch up.
<<change lvSan 5>>
<<like 신아산>>
<<play 신아산_웃음>>
ASan: Really??????
ASan: I guess jogging around the park once a week really helped improve my stamina.
(Once a week? That's way too little for a workout!!!!!!)
ASan: Since I'm in a good mood after winning~ I'll buy this time.
<<show san_idle_ver2>>
ASan: Don't get the wrong idea, it's not like I'm doing this because I like you or anything.
<<show san_smile_ver2>>
<<play 신아산_웃음>>
ASan: Let's go!!!!!!
<<end>>
===

title: 밤_4_조깅하기_신아산_부정1_영문
---
{name()}: See ya later~!!!!!!!!
<<show san_neg_ver2>>
ASan: Hey!!!!!!!!!
(I beat ASan easily.)
ASan: You... how are you so fast...
ASan: Even though I've been jogging around the park once a week, I still couldn't win!!!!!!!!!!
{name()}: Once a week is way too little, don't you think?
{name()}: Does that even count as exercise?
<<show san_neg2_ver2>>
<<change lvSan -5>>
<<dislike 신아산>>
<<play 신아산_허>>
ASan: Whatever.
ASan: Fine, you've got great stamina.
{name()}: Are you sulking?
ASan: No.
<<if get("gold") >= 10>>
    <<jump 밤_4_조깅하기_신아산_물o_영문>>
<<else>>
    <<jump 밤_4_조깅하기_신아산_물x_영문>>
<<endif>>
===

title: 밤_4_조깅하기_신아산_물o_영문
---
{name()}: You're totally sulking, aren't you?
<<play 신아산_허>>
ASan: I. SAID. NO.
{name()}: Since I won, I'll buy the drinks.
{name()}: Let's go.
<<show san_blush_ver2>>
ASan: You're so mean...
ASan: I'm going to pick the most expensive thing there.
<<change gold -10>>
<<change lvSan 5>>
<<like 신아산>>
(Spent 10 gold to buy ASan a drink.)
(Holding our drinks, ASan and I headed back to our respective homes.)
<<end>>
===

title: 밤_4_조깅하기_신아산_물x_영문
---
{name()}: Well, then I suggest you exercise more often~.
ASan: .........
<<show san_neg_ver2>>
<<change lvSan -5>>
<<dislike 신아산>>
<<play 신아산_허>>
ASan: Stop teasing me.
{name()}: Why? I'm just telling the truth.
<<notice "You feel a pang of guilt.">>
<<change karma +1>>
ASan: Whatever.
ASan: I'm going home.
<<end>>
===